Create or update a signature inline

Usage: mxr signatures set <NAME> <BODY>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Human-readable signature name
  <BODY>  Signature body. The RFC 3676 `-- ` delimiter is inserted at compose time if absent

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
